  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Business valuation careers involve estimating what a business or asset is worth using financial models, and they reward careful modelling and plain explanation of assumptions.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

