        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Build a simple model</strong></td>
          <td data-label="What to do">Project a few years of cash flows with stated assumptions</td>
          <td data-label="Output">A spreadsheet</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Compare with peers</strong></td>
          <td data-label="What to do">List two or three similar companies and their ratios</td>
          <td data-label="Output">A comparison table</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Show a range</strong></td>
          <td data-label="What to do">Change two assumptions and show results</td>
          <td data-label="Output">A sensitivity table</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Write one page</strong></td>
          <td data-label="What to do">State method, assumptions and limits</td>
